OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with showers or longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain, these heavy at times through
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight. Strong
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds with coastal gales
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,13,Ffrequent showers, some heavy. A very
OL,14,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales.
OL,15,
